th. However, she DOESN'T steal years off his life like any decent Shinigami would do. Oh no, instead she sucks him dry of something much more perverse by leeching off his lecherous spirit and draining his ability to enjoy... er... the things that teenage boys normally spend most of their time thinking about! And now that he's been de-debased and de-debauched by her un-dirty trick, the poor regenerated degenerate's only hope of getting his licentiousness renewed is to join the queen of mental-clean on her quest, since when she leaves our mortal plane he regains his normal immorality! But the termination of the probation of his reprobation isn't guaranteed, because the Goddesses of Death can be really a harsh mistresses and it's going to be anything but easy to go back to being sleazy!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Nudity","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":40,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"So, I Can't Play H!","english":"So, I Can't Play H!","native":"だから僕は、Hができない。","romaji":"Dakara Boku wa, H ga Dekinai.","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"美少女死神 还我H之魂"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"所以我才只能做魔法师"}]},"trailer":{"id":"a7QLbvl5iYU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a7QLbvl5iYU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}